> q32(x: u32) = isqrt(x)
> range q32
range of q32 -> u32:
  0..65535
  fits in u16
  sampled 65536 points (domain has 4294967296 points); not exhaustive
  sound bound (intervals): 0..65535
  proved bound (monotonicity, exact algebra): 0..65535
  the sample reaches both ends: the range is exactly 0..65535 (proved)
    max: q32 is nondecreasing in x, so take x = 4294967295:
      65535
    min: q32 is nondecreasing in x, so take x = 0:
      0
